  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Qin Bai Sheng’s fourth sword light from five finger fist heart sword is already in the air when a figure appears in front of Lang Ya land spirit and blocks it. Fang Yuan, still in the cloud building, senses an unknown aura and names it a rank seven Gu Immortal. Eight more figures then land around the pit to protect the land spirit.",
      "chapters": [
        881
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_qin_bai_sheng",
        "char_lang_ya_land_spirit",
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "sys_gu_immortal"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "That same rank seven hairy man Gu Immortal, who blocked the strike for Lang Ya land spirit, later falls to the ground. The other hairy man Gu Immortals cry his name. A female hairy man Gu Immortal, Second Hair, kneels beside him, hugs his chest, and finds his body already filled with sword energy and no longer alive. Lang Ya land spirit inspects the dead immortal, heaves a bitter sigh, and closes his aggrieved eyelids. Second Hair screams, falls on the corpse, and faints.",
      "chapters": [
        882
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_second_hair"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan judges that Lang Ya land spirit raised these hairy man Gu Immortals as refinement assistants, expert at refining Gu and not specialized in battle.",
      "chapters": [
        882
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "After he falls, his body is filled with sword energy. Second Hair hugs his chest. Lang Ya land spirit closes his aggrieved eyelids.",
      "chapters": [
        882
      ],
